Serialized via serde_json & timestamped with chrono::Local.

## Active Tauri v2 Dependencies
- **tauri v2** + **tauri-plugin-opener**: Native shell & external URI handling
- **tauri-plugin-sql** + **rusqlite (bundled)**: Zero-config embedded SQLite
